{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54822","headline":"兵要望江南 占树第十六（五首） 一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占树第十六（五首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城（京本作「营」）中树，忽然总萎黄。\n威气（京本作「风」）助吾军必胜，阴神佑我必成强，主将喜非常。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}